data.activities:
- Fundraising and partnering;
- Community engagement, obtaining a social license to operate;
- Construct and establish a network of 3 x off-grid connected mbora Hubs; 
- Recruit, select & train a local mbora Team to operate the new mbora Hubs and outgrower schemes;
- Establish the outgrower schemes by funding farmers to receive irrigation systems and inputs;
- Schedule village banking and market days to finance farmers, and buy produce from farmers.
